{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/63407f3d68674d2c6721a7ba99539d22.avif?t=1773327258\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Out of Water</strong>, you step into the daily life of Watarholt - a northern Germanic village preparing for winter - and experience its slow unraveling through your own choices. What begins as a calm, grounded look into village life soon shifts into mystery, grief, and danger as you become the one people turn to when things start to go wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/34c8fc0a68bb741593d80bba2f28f346.poster.avif?t=1773327258\" width=800 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/34c8fc0a68bb741593d80bba2f28f346.webm?t=1773327258\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The harvest is done. The lake runs still. But something in Watarholt is changing... and you feel it before anyone else does.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/ec25ea494fe4b9bd80938e59442cf434.avif?t=1773327258\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore this world through conversations, relationships, and the rhythms of village life. You decide how you speak to others, how you comfort them, how much you trust them - and how much they trust you. As the woods grow hostile and the waters turn deadly, you shape how the people around you respond to fear, tradition, and the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/5fdca787a71d2c36a5d774ec4c79c0af.avif?t=1773327258\" width=152 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions shape the story. Choose your words carefully - not every outcome will turn out well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build trust, challenge beliefs, or push others away. Your relationships and reputation define your path through grief, faith, and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/d5cf9541aa3dd2a87021fdad6c359c5d.avif?t=1773327258\" width=152 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world brought to life through hand-drawn characters and environments, subtly animated to capture the stillness and unease of a fading summer. Every expression, every silence tells part of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/0d748ddeb0656f6291bec7d6c3e940b7.avif?t=1773327258\" width=152 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your name, demeanor, and worldview. Out of Water invites you to project yourself into its world - the protagonist is defined not by presets, but by your imagination and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/57ca9dcbeb80805503544b6da57a65d8.avif?t=1773327258\" width=152 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romance is entirely optional. You may form deep bonds - as friends, allies, or lovers - with one of three men: Harik, Ansgar, or Basi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path with each is shaped by trust, belief, and shared experience. Love changes the story, but it\u2019s never required to complete it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/2ce617d59f0f4ae5fad8c6c871f340ed.avif?t=1773327258\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tale of Watarholt unfolds at your pace, through your choices, and in your voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/03dc320b046dd6d8f64b348ffb0596ef.avif?t=1773327258\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3907840?t=1773327258","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/3b4aface08630297d5f43230117f612af8e510a8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773327258","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/68f8bd1f9cd20cace247043be3e074bcf4a784f3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773327258","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/68f8bd1f9cd20cace247043be3e074bcf4a784f3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773327258","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game includes themes of death and war in a fantasy setting and may not be suitable for younger audiences.\r\nPeople are depicted drinking in social s