eight=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romance is entirely optional. You may form deep bonds - as friends, allies, or lovers - with one of three men: Harik, Ansgar, or Basi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path with each is shaped by trust, belief, and shared experience. Love changes the story, but it\u2019s never required to complete it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/2ce617d59f0f4ae5fad8c6c871f340ed.avif?t=1773327258\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tale of Watarholt unfolds at your pace, through your choices, and in your voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/extras/03dc320b046dd6d8f64b348ffb0596ef.avif?t=1773327258\" width=330 height=83 /></span></p>","developers":["lapys games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3907840/aaaec18b4cefd328bc8f07e0ffbd84ef5896201b/header.jpg?t=1773327258","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel-compatible (Apple silicon supported through Rosetta 2)<br></li><li><strong>M